the level of a spellbook without reading it.'  'Well, fine,' you say,
'but that doesn't help much, does it?'
  Well, no, not really.  But the Wheaton spoilers have a list of what level
Wizard you have to be to read what spellbook.  I also have a list of it,
if anyone wants it mailed to them.  By level 7, I think, a wizard can
read any spellbook.  Barbarians (at the other end of the scale) work
pretty much the same as Wizards + 8 levels (this I played once; I've no
idea if this was just *my* barbarian or any.  I think it's any barbarian.)
So, a level 8 Barbarian can read a level 1 spell. Casting it's another matter..

